1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,468
Di Gurun Sahara,

2
00:00:01,468 --> 00:00:04,008
ilmuwan menemukan tengkorak babun...

3
00:00:04,008 --> 00:00:05,853
berlubang bekas cakar elang!

4
00:00:05,853 --> 00:00:08,552
Babunnya seberat 26 kilo...

5
00:00:08,552 --> 00:00:10,952
elangnya cuma sekitar 4 kilo!

6
00:00:10,952 --> 00:00:11,974
Padahal,

7
00:00:11,974 --> 00:00:15,764
elang dikira tak sanggup
memangsa primata di atas 13 kilo.

8
00:00:15,764 --> 00:00:17,073
Masalahnya...

9
00:00:17,073 --> 00:00:20,327
nenek moyang manusia dulu
juga seukuran babun ini.

10
00:00:20,327 --> 00:00:24,613
Bahkan tengkorak anak manusia purba
berumur hampir 3 juta tahun...

11
00:00:24,613 --> 00:00:27,133
punya bekas cakar elang di rongga matanya!

12
00:00:27,133 --> 00:00:27,659
Follow,

13
00:00:27,659 --> 00:00:29,984
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
